did to you, but suddenly you feel very happy.</span>\"\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\"><img alt=\"Bar of Chocolate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bar_of_Chocolate_988acd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\">Cream Cake</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Cream Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cream_Cake_991ebb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Banana\">Bananas</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Banana\"><img alt=\"Banana\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Banana_aabcfc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vials</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\"><img alt=\"Milk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Milk_105cbe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Sling%20Herb\">Sling Herb</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sling%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Sling Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sling_Herb_808869.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\">Star Herb</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Star Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p>It can be obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a> and from a <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass-Shod%20Chest\">Brass-Shod Chest</a> inside the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Bastion\">Cobra Bastion</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Banana\">Banana</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass-Shod%20Chest\">Brass-Shod Chest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\">Cream Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-ques